# NOTE: .vercelignore applies at the initial repo clone, BEFORE each
# Vercel project's own Root Directory is applied — so it is shared across
# every project built from this repo, not just the backend. Do not list
# `frontend/` here: that would also strip it from the frontend Vercel
# project's own build (whose Root Directory *is* frontend/), deleting its
# package.json before `npm install` ever runs.
#
# Everything below is for local dev or the Render deployment only, and
# isn't needed by either Vercel project.
tests/
test_api.py
/main.py
render.yaml
KEEP_AWAKE_GUIDE.md
image.png
original-013caca786154faf013fb18e55e8ffcf.webp
.venv/
__pycache__/
